==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Steelix|139}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Heavy Impact''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Dark Steelix|10}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

